<title>SPAIN: Spain's Pryca Q1 group pretax up 5 percent.</title>
<headline>Spain's Pryca Q1 group pretax up 5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter results for Spanish hypermarket chain Pryca, in billion pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	    5.72		   5.45</p>
<p>    Net  profit		3.75		   n.a.</p>
<p>    Gross turnover	 134.80		 136.18</p>
<p>    Net turnover	   122.22		 123.52</p>
<p>NOTE - Pryca added in a statement that it revalued its balance sheet by 21.27 billion pesetas, meaning an additional depreciation charge of 2.73 billion pesetas in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
